{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31028","headline":"咏柳花 · 薛能","name":"咏柳花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浮生失意频，起絮又飘沦。\n发自谁家树，飞来独院春。\n朝容萦断砌，晴影过诸邻。\n乱掩宫中蝶，繁冲陌上人。\n随波应到海，沾雨或依尘。\n会向慈恩日，轻轻对此身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31028.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31028","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}